  <description>
    <p>One model. Every plan, section and schedule. BimCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in BimCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Open an IFC model and look around in 3D</li>
      <li>Show and hide storeys, spaces and edges</li>
      <li>Find elements by class, name or property</li>
      <li>Find your way with the model tree</li>
      <li>Hide, isolate and see through elements</li>
      <li>Cut an IFC model with a section plane</li>
      <li>Color elements by a property</li>
      <li>See several IFC models together</li>
      <li>Measure distances and face areas in 3D</li>
      <li>Issues and BCF files</li>
      <li>Check for clashes</li>
      <li>Pick an element and read its properties</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
